57bm-i14"],"evidence_ids":["mapping.long.record-257bm-i14"],"id":"long.record-257bm-i14","kind":"claim","label":"Long record Proposition 6.123 (A finite band check for $`13\\le d\\le30`$)","locator":"Long record Proposition 6.123, p. 78, label record:257bm-i14","source_id":"paper.long.pdf","statement":"*For every actual upper-reset index $13\\le d\\le30$ and every $0\\le j\\le d$, the linked certificate verifies\n$$\n2^{d-j+1}<\\mathrm{resetCharge}\n\\quad\\text{or}\\quad\n\\mathrm{resetCharge}+2(d+j)\\le2^{d-j+1}.\n$$\nIt computes the successor remainder at each row $d+1$, from $\\mathrm{rem}(14)=392$ through $\\mathrm{rem}(31)=4187487147$. This proves the required condition on a finite range, not the universal condition for all $d\\ge13$. A proof for unbounded reset indices must supply a further argument; repeatedly extending the table alone does not establish that statement.*","status":"unverified"},"ref":"sha256:264b08973a5f23b2f98ad989b0c1708096513d86929f19048623a2a9fe18092c/nodes/long.record-257bm-i14","relations":[{"derived":false,"family":"arguments","from":"sha256:264b08973a5f23b2f98ad989b0c1708096513d86929f19048623a2a9fe18092c/nodes/long.record-257bm-i14","id":"sha256:264b08973a5f23b2f98ad989b0c1708096513d86929f19048623a2a9fe18092c/edges/%5B%22long.record-257bm-i14%22%2C%22lean.ErdosProblems.Erdos257.PaperCompleteR21.paper_finite_band_check_thirteen_to_thirty%22%2C%22formalizes%22%5D","kind":"formalizes","record_ref":"sha256:264b08973a5f23b2f98ad989b0c1708096513d86929f19048623a2a9fe18092c/edges/%5B%22long.record-257bm-i14%22%2C%22lean.ErdosProblems.Erdos257.PaperCompleteR21.paper_finite_band_check_thirteen_to_thirty%22%2C%22formalizes%22%5D","semantic_class":"formalization_correspondence","to":"sha256:264b08973a5f23b2f98ad989b0c1708096513d86929f19048623a2a9fe18092c/nodes/lean.ErdosProblems.Erdos257.PaperCompleteR21.paper_finite_band_check_thirteen_to_thirty"},{"derived":false,"family":"arguments","from":"sha256:264b08973a5f23b2f98ad989b0c1708096513d86929f1